Source: faugus-launcher
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, python3, dh-python, gettext, desktop-file-utils, appstream, libgtk-4-bin
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Faugus/faugus-launcher

Package: faugus-launcher
Architecture: all
# Pure-Python meson app: dh_python3 resolves the module deps; the GI
# typelibs and remaining modules are explicit (all verified present on
# Debian Testing and Unstable).
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-manette-0.2, python3-gi, python3-requests, python3-pil, python3-vdf, python3-psutil, python3-icoextract, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Lightweight app for running Windows games using UMU-Launcher
 Faugus is a simple and lightweight app for running Windows games using
 UMU-Launcher/UMU-Proton. The umu-run component is downloaded and managed
 by the app itself at runtime.
